Soy milk and Greek-style yogurt provide a solid protein base. Sweet strawberries, sliced banana, and rich cocoa powder create a sweet flavor without added sugar.

### 26. Creamy Raspberry-Peach Chia Seed Smoothie

Chia seeds add a healthy dose of fiber to this fruity smoothie. The natural sweetness of frozen peaches combined with dates and the tangy brightness of raspberries make every sip refreshing.

### 27. Spinach-Avocado Smoothie

Contains **18 grams of protein and 8 grams of fiber** to maximize fullness, along with antioxidants to help reduce inflammation.

### 28. High-Fiber Oat Smoothie with Chia Seeds

Rolled oats, chia seeds, frozen banana, mixed berries, and Greek yogurt blend into a creamy, filling breakfast.

### 29. Kiwi-Granola Breakfast Banana Split

A breakfast-friendly spin on a classic dessert—swap ice cream for yogurt, and load up on seeds, nuts, and fresh fruit.

### 30. Acai Bowl

Top with granola, berries, chia seeds, and sliced banana for a fiber-rich, antioxidant-packed breakfast.

### 31. High-Fiber Muesli with Yogurt, Seeds & Fruit

Rolled oats, wheat bran or oat bran, chia seeds, and your choice of milk or yogurt. For extra fiber, soak overnight.

