## Pancakes, Waffles & Muffins

Yes, you can have pancakes—and get your fiber in too.

### 36. Wholemeal Banana Pancakes

Use wholemeal flour and mashed bananas for naturally sweet, fiber-packed pancakes.

### 37. High-Fiber Whole-Grain Pancakes or Waffles

Swap refined flour for whole wheat or oat flour, and add ground flaxseed or chia seeds to the batter.

